; Node3D, NOT Node. A plain Node in the chain detaches everything below it from
; the 3D hierarchy: Cutscenes/ElevatorIntro would become its own transform root,
; its global transform would equal its local one, and the whole cutscene would
; play at the world origin however the level placed this scene. Nothing errors.
